Z||000000||AusFiero||07-19-2001||04:24 AM||||Well most people probably don't know this but I do the artwork for all the covers for the Pontiac Car Club of Australias bi-monthly magazine. It is a pretty high quality publication and covers everything happening in the Australian Pontiac Scene. Best part it is free to all members of the club which is pretty good when we only pay $35 a year membership.<P>We do actually have international members too who join just for the magazine. I think they pay about $25 US due to the extra shipping involved with magazines.<P>This time around I decided to make a Fiero tribute as appossed to the whining from some members that whinge but my type of car has never been on the cover. Well bad luck for them this time. Our 3 Fiero owning members get a treat.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/julyaugustcover.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR><A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Haze_Performance||07-19-2001||04:40 AM||||Hmmmmmmm... Am I able to buy that issue?  If so how $$$?<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">  <BR></A><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Click above to visit my website.</B></FONT></FONT>||||reg||14
Z||000002||AusFiero||07-19-2001||04:52 AM||||Haze what are you doing up at such an ungodly hour of the morning  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>The magazine hasn't got any Fiero content this issue unfortunately but I just did a Fiero cover anyway. Well it may have a few pics from the nats of my car and the other few Fieros that turned up. I am waiting for my issue to come in the mail so I am not sure on whats in it yet. I will ask the club how much they want for an issue. Will probably only be about US$10, $8 of which is shipping. <P>Did you ever get the Unique Cars Magazine I sent you? <P>I have been asked to write a regular Fiero section on tips etc I gather here, will probably do it one day when I am better and have more time.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR><A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Haze_Performance||07-19-2001||05:06 AM||||<B>Haze what are you doing up at such an ungodly hour of the morning   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P></B>I never sleep  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <B><P>The magazine hasn't got any Fiero content this issue unfortunately but I just did a Fiero cover anyway. Well it may have a few pics from the nats of my car and the other few Fieros that turned up. I am waiting for my issue to come in the mail so I am not sure on whats in it yet. I will ask the club how much they want for an issue. Will probably only be about US$10, $8 of which is shipping. </B><P>Please let me know when you can. I don't care if theres any Fieros in it or not. Its just a cool cover. <B><P>Did you ever get the Unique Cars Magazine I sent you? <P></B>YES!!!! Thank You very much. I just got it yesterday. There was even a Fiero in it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <B><P>I have been asked to write a regular Fiero section on tips etc I gather here, will probably do it one day when I am better and have more time. </B><P>If theres ever any more Fiero covers or articles, please let me know. Thank you..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">  <BR></A><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Click above to visit my website.</B></FONT></FONT>||||reg||14
